    {
      "id": "claim_95d04be13aa2436e88bb081229d5f85f",
      "statement": "On the Whisper path the browser never runs inference: the vendored vtype-core library records 16 kHz audio, WAV-encodes it client-side, and posts it to /api/voice/transcribe, which the Hub relays to a Whisper server, while both the browser-recognition and Whisper engines are created in one place (voice-engine.ts) and voice.ts/voice-whisper.ts keep only the UI.",
