    {
      "id": "claim_564f91efdd5242a9b56c441462ccce66",
      "statement": "With voice.whisper.managed set, the first transcription request starts whisper-server as a child process bound to 127.0.0.1 on the configured port if free or otherwise a newly picked free port, with thread count set to the host CPU count and start-up serialized against concurrent requests; the child is tied to the Hub's lifetime via a Windows Job Object with KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE, a Setpgid process group killed as a group on Linux/macOS, and tini as PID 1 in Docker as a backstop.",
