      "id": "claim_90d112404b534a08a73328fbc5efba63",
      "statement": "Downloadable managed Whisper install is defined only for windows/amd64 in the whisperBinaries table (Linux/macOS pending self-built release assets, and the Docker image instead bakes whisper-server in via MANY_AI_CLI_WHISPER_SERVER); everything it installs lands under ~/.many-ai-cli/whisper/{bin,models,tmp}/, downloads are HTTPS-only and SHA256-verified before being renamed into place with a failed download's temp file deleted, a model download is preceded by a free-disk-space check, and uninstall is a plain os.RemoveAll of that directory tree.",
