      "id": "claim_203440112a7f4cceb239095e8f82df6e",
      "statement": "The Whisper hallucination filter runs in the Hub: handleVoiceTranscribe rejects a transcript that, after normalization (lower-casing, whitespace and trailing punctuation removed), exactly equals one of voice.whisper.hallucination_phrases, which defaults to a fixed list of phrases Whisper emits on silence; a partial match is never discarded and an explicit empty list disables the filter.",
